# MASTER IMPLEMENTATION PROMPT
# AICTE FlowGuard — Institutional Dashboard and End-to-End Application Tracking
## SIH26262 | Fresh Project | Applicant-Side Workflow

Build the complete Institutional Dashboard for AICTE FlowGuard, a prototype for SIH problem statement SIH26262.

This is a fresh implementation. Do not assume that previous code, databases, APIs, authentication modules or dashboards exist.

The institutional dashboard is the applicant-facing workspace through which an institution representative files applications, uploads supporting documents, receives deficiency notices, tracks every processing stage, coordinates with AICTE through the simulated workflow, receives decisions and uses permitted appeal procedures.

Implement a functional application, not just a static dashboard mockup.

