- Other programme-specific prerequisites from the relevant APH chapter or annexure.

Generate the checklist only after resolving the applicable programme, level and institution type.

## Application 6: Merger of Institutions

Source: Annexure 2, Section 2.4, and Chapter II, Clause 2.10.2(b).

Checklist:
- Applicable Annexure 2 documents, subject to the explicit exception in Chapter II, Clause 2.10.2(b).
