Evaluate the exception deterministically only after the relevant clause has been verified.

## Application 7: Break in EoA, Restoration or Hibernation

Source: Annexure 2, Section 2.1, and the applicable Chapter II provisions.

Use the self-disclosure checklist from Application 1 where the relevant APH route requires it:
- Affidavit 2 with the prescribed signatory and digital signature.
