### E. Post-Letter of Approval requirements

Track faculty and Principal/Director appointments and prescribed staff information after LoA, according to the applicable APH provisions. Do not allow the software to imply that the institution may commence courses before required appointments and other prerequisites are satisfied.

Track the LoA validity of two academic years where the applicable APH provision prescribes it.

