- Scheduling timestamp.
- Rescheduling/cancellation status.
- Updated visit details and reason for changes.

Send notifications after authorised scheduling, rescheduling or cancellation.

The institution should be able to acknowledge the visit notification, subject to configured policy.

The EVC coordinator must manage member assignment and availability. The system must not fabricate member identities, availability or inspection outcomes.

## 9.1 EVC evidence and report

When the EVC completes the inspection, the institution dashboard may display permitted visit-status updates.

Track:
- Visit completed timestamp.
- Report submission status.
- Evidence received status.
- Post-EVC review status.
- Outstanding institution action, if any.

Do not reveal restricted internal EVC deliberations or member-only records to applicants.

